# Hermetic test runner: type-check (svelte-check), unit/component tests
# (Vitest, includes the real-model Silero ONNX integration test — the model is
# vendored in static/models/), and the Playwright e2e suite, all in one image.
#
# The base image version MUST match the @playwright/test version in
# package-lock.json — the image ships the exact browser builds that library
# version expects, so no `playwright install` is needed.
FROM mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.61.1-noble

WORKDIR /app

# Dependency layer first so source-only changes don't re-run npm ci.
COPY package.json package-lock.json .npmrc ./
RUN npm ci

COPY . .

# The e2e webServer builds the app and serves it on :4173 internally, so this
# needs no network beyond what the tests stub. Run with --ipc=host: Chromium
# can exhaust a container's default /dev/shm.
CMD ["bash", "-c", "npm run check && npm test && npm run test:e2e"]
